--- !u!114 &2624329
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2624327}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: aea490f53db83604eae9c1658210a5b5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  tutorialKey: tut_encounter_v1
  autoOpenOnEnable: 1
  pages:
  - icon: {fileID: 1006166679981420889, guid: 10c4c40dbdebe477bb559690eb655118, type: 3}
    text: 'The Rift Operations panel is where Energy is allocated to initiate a new
      operation.

      It displays current Energy, regeneration rate, team preview,
      and any active operation boosts.'
  - icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5b05ebb3f339e4f03b3026941ea99ecc, type: 3}
    text: 'The opposing panel shows Bitling details, including name, level, type,
      and active modifiers.

      Higher-risk Bitlings typically yield greater rewards.'
  - icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5b05ebb3f339e4f03b3026941ea99ecc, type: 3}
    text: Your active team is displayed here, providing a clear view of assigned
      Bitlings before deployment.
  - icon: {fileID: 3239880121721825974, guid: bfb12dc30a4e1445298547f6c0d3d850, type: 3}
    text: Operations may be unavailable if Energy is insufficient or system conditions
      are not met.
  - icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5b05ebb3f339e4f03b3026941ea99ecc, type: 3}
    text: 'Following certain operations, a recruitment decision may be presented.

      Confirm
      the outcome to proceed.'
  - icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5b05ebb3f339e4f03b3026941ea99ecc, type: 3}
    text: 'Successful operations generate Credits, Growth Cores, and other progression
      resources.

      Higher-difficulty operations yield increased returns.'
  - icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5b05ebb3f339e4f03b3026941ea99ecc, type: 3}
    text: 'Select Battle to initiate a manual engagement.

      Each turn is directed
      through controlled action selection.'
  - icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5b05ebb3f339e4f03b3026941ea99ecc, type: 3}
    text: Rift Operations reward careful decision-making, balancing stability and
      progression.
  overlayRoot: {fileID: 848981255}
  dimmerImage: {fileID: 1066735938}
  iconImage: {fileID: 767817845}
  bodyText: {fileID: 1334329686}
  progressText: {fileID: 923841516}
