--- !u!114 &12991259
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 12991257}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: aea490f53db83604eae9c1658210a5b5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  tutorialKey: tut_battle_v1
  autoOpenOnEnable: 0
  pages:
  - icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5b05ebb3f339e4f03b3026941ea99ecc, type: 3}
    text: 'This is a turn-based engagement.

      Each turn, an action is selected,
      the opposing Bitling responds, and actions resolve in sequence until one side
      is overcome.'
  - icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5b05ebb3f339e4f03b3026941ea99ecc, type: 3}
    text: 'Turn order is influenced by speed, active conditions, and applied modifiers.

      After
      each exchange, damage and status changes are applied before the next turn begins.'
  - icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5b05ebb3f339e4f03b3026941ea99ecc, type: 3}
    text: 'Available actions include Attack, Defend, Focus, Swap, and Run.

      Each
      decision affects the flow and outcome of the engagement.'
  - icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5b05ebb3f339e4f03b3026941ea99ecc, type: 3}
    text: Bitling types influence performance, with interactions that can strengthen
      or reduce effectiveness depending on the matchup.
  - icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5b05ebb3f339e4f03b3026941ea99ecc, type: 3}
    text: Titles adjust performance and behavior, enhancing output, improving defense,
      or modifying conditions at the start of engagement.
  - icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5b05ebb3f339e4f03b3026941ea99ecc, type: 3}
    text: Some actions may result in critical outcomes, producing increased impact
      based on Bitling attributes and applied Titles.
  - icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5b05ebb3f339e4f03b3026941ea99ecc, type: 3}
    text: 'Successful engagements generate Credits and Growth Cores before returning
      to Rift Operations.

      Unsuccessful engagements conclude without rewards.'
  - icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5b05ebb3f339e4f03b3026941ea99ecc, type: 3}
    text: Consistent success is achieved through balanced team composition, effective
      type alignment, strong Title combinations, and well-timed decisions.
