  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: aea490f53db83604eae9c1658210a5b5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  tutorialKey: tut_evolution_v1
  autoOpenOnEnable: 1
  pages:
  - icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5b05ebb3f339e4f03b3026941ea99ecc, type: 3}
    text: This panel displays detailed market information for a selected Bitling,
      including type, rarity, valuation, demand, and trend.
  - icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5b05ebb3f339e4f03b3026941ea99ecc, type: 3}
    text: "Valuation reflects the Bitling\u2019s current market value, with indicators
      showing upward or downward movement."
  - icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5b05ebb3f339e4f03b3026941ea99ecc, type: 3}
    text: "Demand and trend provide insight into market direction, showing whether
      a Bitling\u2019s value is rising, falling, or remaining stable."
  - icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5b05ebb3f339e4f03b3026941ea99ecc, type: 3}
    text: Broker payout displays the current Credit return for the selected Bitling,
      indicating its immediate exchange value.
  - icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5b05ebb3f339e4f03b3026941ea99ecc, type: 3}
    text: Forecast and Monopoly Bonus unlock later, providing projected demand insights
      and increased valuation for controlled types.
  - icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5b05ebb3f339e4f03b3026941ea99ecc, type: 3}
    text: Bull and Bear tokens allow controlled influence over Bitling valuation
      once available.
