  - icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5b05ebb3f339e4f03b3026941ea99ecc, type: 3}
    text: 'This panel allows Bitlings to be assigned to a job site.

      Assigned
      Bitlings operate automatically and generate resources over time.'
  - icon: {fileID: 1420780651364645667, guid: 9923bea833c8b4a55934a79e6f41459f, type: 3}
    text: 'Select an empty slot to assign a Bitling.

      Available slots increase
      as job sites are upgraded.'
  - icon: {fileID: -184233537094302185, guid: 6b23ba550c98a4db89080b5bf92724f0, type: 3}
    text: 'Job progress is tracked here, with rewards ready for collection once complete.

      Bitlings
      may require rest before returning to work.'
  - icon: {fileID: -923432448004486077, guid: 7f1ca29997ecc4af18e4b9811ea64c05, type: 3}
    text: Efficient assignment supports steady resource production across BRN operations.
