  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: aea490f53db83604eae9c1658210a5b5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  tutorialKey: tut_cryolab_v1
  autoOpenOnEnable: 1
  pages:
  - icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c0d35dc1fadd0b14f90e3ce1ffb77280, type: 3}
    text: The Cryo Lab uses Work Orders to activate a temporary bonus that improves
      capture performance for a limited time.
  - icon: {fileID: -184922529597343108, guid: 242083f04895f496db58523ff283ee47, type: 3}
    text: Activating a Work Order consumes one Work Order and applies the boost immediately.
  - icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5b05ebb3f339e4f03b3026941ea99ecc, type: 3}
    text: Availability depends on current Work Order supply.
  - icon: {fileID: -184233537094302185, guid: 6b23ba550c98a4db89080b5bf92724f0, type: 3}
    text: An active Work Order displays a countdown timer and expires automatically
      when time runs out.
  - icon: {fileID: -923432448004486077, guid: 7f1ca29997ecc4af18e4b9811ea64c05, type: 3}
    text: Only one Work Order can be active at a time, and applying a new one replaces
      the current effect.
