  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: aea490f53db83604eae9c1658210a5b5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  tutorialKey: tut_battlelog_v1
  autoOpenOnEnable: 1
  pages:
  - icon: {fileID: 3321169378428917069, guid: d2a224ffc5dd14cd9bea2e051ae55a5d, type: 3}
    text: The Battle Log records actions and key updates during Rift Operations,
      allowing each engagement to be reviewed in detail.
  - icon: {fileID: -1452550890681560563, guid: 7cf1507c7d54444958852c79bb125e96, type: 3}
    text: Auto-Scroll can be adjusted to either follow the latest updates or remain
      fixed for easier reading.
  - icon: {fileID: -923432448004486077, guid: 7f1ca29997ecc4af18e4b9811ea64c05, type: 3}
    text: After an engagement, selecting Continue prepares the log for the next operation
      and clears previous records.
  - icon: {fileID: -6288249182244823202, guid: bde71cd552fb546aaa1d2775dd746969, type: 3}
    text: Auto-Scroll preferences can be managed in Settings to match your viewing
      preference.
