  pages:
  - icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 710e1cb759d0f7c43bc3e98d58b8c293, type: 3}
    text: The Shadow Market uses Shiny Orbs to activate a temporary Premium Bitling
      boost.
  - icon: {fileID: 3084012362977371794, guid: e2d3b8730a443435bb167b9bcdacd4eb, type: 3}
    text: Activating the boost consumes one Shiny Orb and applies a limited-time
      increase to Premium encounter rates.
  - icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5b05ebb3f339e4f03b3026941ea99ecc, type: 3}
    text: The active boost displays a countdown timer and ends automatically when
      time expires.
  - icon: {fileID: -923432448004486077, guid: 7f1ca29997ecc4af18e4b9811ea64c05, type: 3}
    text: Only one boost can be active at a time, and applying a new one replaces
      the current effect.
