  pages:
  - icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 09b596ef54e6648b5a83907abb5c3e89, type: 3}
    text: The Harbor allows Flyers to increase the chance of encountering a selected
      Bitling type for a limited time.
  - icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: fb4479ed54fe64621a9e7a735eeffad8, type: 3}
    text: Select a Bitling type to view current encounter probability and projected
      increase.
  - icon: {fileID: 3321169378428917069, guid: d2a224ffc5dd14cd9bea2e051ae55a5d, type: 3}
    text: Activating a Flyer applies a temporary boost, with availability based on
      current Flyer count.
  - icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5b05ebb3f339e4f03b3026941ea99ecc, type: 3}
    text: Active Flyers are displayed with a timer, and applying a new Flyer replaces
      the existing effect.
